Account
  #initialize
    sets the owner
    defaults the currency to USD
    rejects a negative balance
  #deposit
    increases the balance
    records a ledger entry
    rejects zero amounts
    rejects amounts over the daily limit
  #withdraw
    decreases the balance
    records a ledger entry
    refuses to overdraw
    allows overdraft on premium accounts
  #close
    requires a zero balance
    archives the ledger

Invoice
  #total
    sums the line items
    applies the tax rate
    rounds half up (FAILED - 1)
    ignores cancelled lines
  #paid?
    is false until fully paid
    is true after the last payment
  #send_reminder
    emails the billing contact
    skips paid invoices
    does not email more than once a day

Order
  .create
    reserves stock for every line
    rolls back when stock is short
    assigns the next order number
  #ship
    marks the order as shipped
    sends the tracking email
    refuses to ship an unpaid order
  #cancel
    releases reserved stock
    refunds a captured payment
    is idempotent

Api::V1::OrdersController
  GET /api/v1/orders
    returns the current user's orders
    paginates
    filters by status
    requires authentication
  POST /api/v1/orders
    creates an order
    returns 422 for an empty cart
    returns 403 for a suspended account
  DELETE /api/v1/orders/:id
    cancels the order
    returns 404 for someone else's order

